            "slot": "s2418",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · My 12-year-old, 15-pound Maltipoo has …",
            "text": "My 12-year-old, 15-pound Maltipoo has always been a picky eater, but with Maev, she eagerly finishes every meal and actually looks forward to mealtime. As a senior dog, I wanted to give her better nutrition to support her gut and joint health, and so far, we're loving both the food and the results. Her stools are healthy and well-formed, which has been great to see. While she still experiences some arthritic tremors in her hind legs, her overall well-being seems improved. We're very happy with Maev and plan to keep it as part of her routine.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
