            "slot": "s2463",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I lost my Rottweiler to a heart attack…",
            "text": "I lost my Rottweiler to a heart attack at 9 year young, a few years back and it crushed me. I decided at that moment that I was not going to lose another fur baby too early so I began trying different healthy whole foods until I discovered the MAEV plan and the raw diet works great with my silver lab, Hank. He has a lot of food allergies but this food has trimmed him down and his coat is healthy and shiny. I absolutley love Maev",
